LangChain

LangChain is a framework used for:

LLM applications
RAG systems
Agent development
Prompt management

Advantages:

Reduces manual coding effort.
Connects LLMs with external tools.
Simplifies building AI applications.
LangGraph

LangGraph is used to:

Build AI agents with workflows.
Create multi-step reasoning systems.
Manage complex agent interactions.
Groq

Groq provides fast inference for LLMs through APIs.

Uses:

Running LLMs quickly.
Lower latency responses.
Integration with LangChain.

Example:

from langchain_groq import ChatGroq

llm = ChatGroq(
    model="llama-3.3-70b-versatile"
)
API Key

